<title>MEXICO: Telmex in share buyback, SBC cuts stake.</title>
<headline>Telmex in share buyback, SBC cuts stake.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonos de Mexico said on Friday it bought back 149.35 million L shares in the market at a price of 13 pesos per share, and that SBC International had cut its stake in the Mexican phone giant to 10 percent from 11.5 percent.</p>
<p>It said the reduction in the SBC stake was aimed at helping Telmex take part in telecommunications services in the United States. It gave no more details.</p>
<p>((-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560))</p>
